 598:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * Stop CCNT, ICNT, M1CNT, M2CNT, M3CNT and return their values;
 599:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * Note: The CCTRL is reset to 0, for more accurate measurements and has to be initialized again be
 600:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 601:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval IfxCpu_Perf Performance counter result.
 602:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  */
