 630:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] address The memory address of the performance counter to be updated. Range: 0 to 0xFF
 631:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] count   Count value to be written to the performance counter. Range: 0 to 0x7FFFFFFF.
 632:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 633:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval None
